      "content": "1.3 COMPONENT DESIGNATORS",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0043",
      "reading_order": 54,
      "section": "1.3 COMPONENT DESIGNATORS",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 210.30286681000007,
        "r": 407.0273463725008,
        "b": 201.40743492803279
      },
      "content": "Components are indicated by alpha-numeric designators, as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0007",
      "reading_order": 55,
      "section": "1.3 COMPONENT DESIGNATORS",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 76.7773208618164,
        "t": 184.0596923828125,
        "r": 492.7117004394531,
        "b": 131.9901123046875
      },
      "markdown": "| Battery   | BT   | Diode              | D   | Resistor   | R   |\n|-----------|------|--------------------|-----|------------|-----|\n| Capacitor | C    | Fuse               | F   | Switch     | SW  |\n| Crystal   | Y    | Integrated Circuit | U   | Transistor | Q   |"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0044",
      "reading_order": 56,
      "section": "1.3 COMPONENT DESIGNATORS",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 114.123034244,
        "r": 503.9687213030997,
        "b": 105.22760236203283
      },
      "content": "The number following the letter is a unique value for each type of component (e.g., R1, R2)."
    },
